# App Style Guide Rules

When writing or editing React components in `components/` or `app/`, always follow the project style guide at `documentation/style_guide.md`. It is the single source of truth for the reusable CSS classes (defined in `app/globals.css`), typography, cards/surfaces, page layout, sheet/dialog headers, icon sizing, and semantic colors — read it before styling work rather than relying on a summary here.

Cursor-specific directives:

- Prefer the reusable CSS classes in `app/globals.css` over inline Tailwind when they match the pattern.
- Do not restate or hand-condense `documentation/style_guide.md` in this rule file; it drifts. Update the style guide itself instead.
